@startuml
[*] --> App Opened

App Opened --> Saving Recipe : Save Recipe
Saving Recipe --> [*] : Recipe Saved

App Opened --> Searching Recipe : Search Recipe
Searching Recipe --> Recipe Found : Recipe Found
Recipe Found --> [*] : View Recipe
Searching Recipe --> Recipe Not Found : No Recipe Found
Recipe Not Found --> [*] : No Recipe Found

App Opened --> Sharing Recipe : Share Recipe
Sharing Recipe --> [*] : Recipe Shared

App Opened --> [*] : Close App
@enduml
